msgstr "القراءات بالنوافذ وتحويل الصيغ"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/reference/cli.md:189
msgid ""
"`pygeofetch stream` is for a single COG URL you already know. To stream "
"whole scenes returned by a search, use `PyGeoFetch.stream()` — see "
"[Streaming](../data-access/streaming.md)."
msgstr ""
"الأمر `pygeofetch stream` مخصص لعنوان URL واحد لـ COG تعرفه مسبقًا. ولبث "
"مشاهد كاملة أعادها البحث، استخدم `PyGeoFetch.stream()` — راجع "
"[البث](../data-access/streaming.md)."

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/reference/cli.md:192
msgid "Processing-chain pipelines"
msgstr "خطوط سلاسل المعالجة"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/reference/cli.md:194
msgid ""
"`pygeofetch proc-pipeline` runs a YAML chain of processing steps on one "
"file. It is distinct from `pygeofetch pipeline`, which orchestrates search, "
"download and export."
msgstr ""
"ينفّذ `pygeofetch proc-pipeline` سلسلة YAML من خطوات المعالجة على ملف واحد. "
"وهو يختلف عن `pygeofetch pipeline` الذي ينسّق البحث والتنزيل والتصدير."

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/reference/cli.md:216
msgid "Configuration and cache"
msgstr "الإعدادات والذاكرة المؤقتة"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/reference/cli.md:233
msgid "Shell completion"
msgstr "الإكمال التلقائي في الصدفة"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/reference/cli.md:239
msgid ""
"This prints the line to add to your shell start-up file (for example "
"`~/.bashrc`); it does not edit the file for you."
msgstr ""
"يطبع هذا السطر الذي تضيفه إلى ملف بدء تشغيل الصدفة لديك (مثل `~/.bashrc`)؛ "
"ولا يحرّر الملف نيابةً عنك."

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/reference/cli.md:242
msgid "Known gaps"
msgstr "الثغرات المعروفة"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/reference/cli.md:244
msgid ""
"The `monitor` command group (`monitor run`, `monitor history`) is "
"implemented in `cli/monitor_commands.py` but is not registered, so "
"`pygeofetch monitor` is not available. See [Known issues](known-issues.md)."
msgstr ""
"مجموعة الأوامر `monitor` (`monitor run` و`monitor history`) منفَّذة في "
"`cli/monitor_commands.py` لكنها غير مسجَّلة، لذا فإن `pygeofetch monitor` "
"غير متاح. راجع [المشكلات المعروفة](known-issues.md)."

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/reference/cli.md:247
msgid ""
"The five SAR pipelines in `pygeofetch.sar.pipelines` (for example "
"`flood_mapping_pipeline`) are available from Python only; they have no CLI "
"command."
msgstr ""
"خطوط SAR الخمسة في `pygeofetch.sar.pipelines` (مثل `flood_mapping_pipeline`)"
" متاحة من Python فقط؛ وليس لها أمر في سطر الأوامر."
